			<entry><nId>1</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/scene/lianhuan.png</sImage><sTips>吃个“三连弹道具”，享受机关扫射的快感吧！拆炮台打砖块必备啊！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>2</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/scene/fensan.png</sImage><sTips>欢乐坦克牌“散弹道具”，三向扇形发射，从此再也不用担心命中率的问题</sTips></entry><entry><nId>3</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/scene/hudun.png</sImage><sTips>一盾在手，天下我有。“护盾”可吸收定量伤害，保护你的生命安全。PS：敌人获得红星状态时，护盾无法提供保护。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>4</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/scene/weizhuang.png</sImage><sTips>消失在敌人视野中，隐藏在暗处，给他致命一击。“隐身道具”，将让你体验一把大刺客的快感。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>5</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/scene/jiasu.png</sImage><sTips>“加速道具”，传说中无惧药检的高级兴奋剂，让你短时间内拥有风一般的速度。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>6</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/scene/yaoxiang.png</sImage><sTips>“补血道具”，一个血包500血，价钱公道，童叟无欺，谁捡到就归谁。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>7</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/scene/hongxing.png</sImage><sTips>有了“红星道具”，护盾、铁块在你面前都是浮云。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>15</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sTips>鼠标左键点击目标，开炮，轰掉一切阻挡你的东西！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>16</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sTips>“WASD”控制坦克移动，不用担心撞墙上！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>17</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sTips>“E”键使用坦克第二技能（小招）。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>18</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sTips>“空格”键使用坦克第三技能（大招）。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>19</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sTips>“G”键可以查看战场内各个玩家的得分情况。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>20</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sTips>“F”键可以在地面喷图，在对方门前喷个“坨”是很威风的！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>21</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sTips>“F11”可让游戏画面切换到全屏状态。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>22</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sTips>将坦克移动到道具图标上，可拾取该道具。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>23</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sTips>鼠标移动到界面下方BUFF图标上，可查看该BUFF的具体信息。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>24</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_penshe.png</sImage><sTips>鼠标移动到界面下方的技能图标上，可查看该技能的具体信息。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>25</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_penshe.png</sImage><sTips>钢铁的小技能可以增加移动速度和攻击力哦！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>26</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_hongzha.png</sImage><sTips>钢铁的大技能可以对一个区域进行轰炸，拆基地必备的哦！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>27</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_hudun.png</sImage><sTips>阿宝的小技能可以祛除目标的负面效果，并加上一个护盾哦！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>28</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_shenlong.png</sImage><sTips>阿宝的大技能可以把自己装扮成刺猬，冲进敌人堆里去哦！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>29</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_genzong.png</sImage><sTips>飞翼的小技能可以发射四个跟踪弹哦！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>30</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_leishe.png</sImage><sTips>飞翼的大技能，像激光大炮一样去攻击敌人！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>31</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/time_moveplace.png</sImage><sTips>网虫的小技能命中了敌人之后可以瞬移到敌人身边</sTips></entry><entry><nId>32</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/time_entwine.png</sImage><sTips>网虫的大技能使用后可以给周围的敌人群缓速。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>33</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_weixiu.png</sImage><sTips>小狸猫的加血小技能哦！还有加速效果的哦！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>34</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_buxue.png</sImage><sTips>小狸猫的大技能，使用了可以群补血！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>35</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_yinshen.png</sImage><sTips>黑暗骑士的小技能，隐身技能，</sTips></entry><entry><nId>36</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_siwangfeixiang.png</sImage><sTips>黑暗骑士的大技能会扫射敌人哦！中炮了之后会持续掉血的！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>37</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_zhengyizhidun.png</sImage><sTips>上尉的小技能，飞遁回旋镖，中招之后会被晕眩的哦！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>38</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_zhihuiguan.png</sImage><sTips>上尉的大技能，化身指挥官，己方的攻击速度和护甲都会提高哦！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>39</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_chixiangjiao.png</sImage><sTips>泰迪熊的小技能，给自己清除不良状态时还能加点血！！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>40</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_xuyuanwanju.png</sImage><sTips>泰迪熊的大技能，可以让对方沉默不能攻击！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>41</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/scene/xiulixiang.png</sImage><sTips>生命值低于一半以下要注意回去补给箱回血</sTips></entry><entry><nId>42</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/scene/xiulixiang.png</sImage><sTips>摧毁对方的补给箱可以給以后的对抗带来很大的优势</sTips></entry><entry><nId>43</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_shirenhua.png</sImage><sTips>豌豆的小技能，在地上种一棵花，这棵花可是会攻击的哦！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>44</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_yingtaozhadan.png</sImage><sTips>豌豆的大技能，放一颗樱桃在身上当人肉炸弹呀！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>45</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_zhenkongbo.png</sImage><sTips>绿巨人的小技能，可以降低在你前面的敌人的攻击速度和移动速度哦！</sTips></entry><entry><nId>46</nId><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/skills/skill_congtianerjiang.png</sImage><sTips>绿巨人的大技能，跳到敌人的位置上，给他沉重的一击。</sTips></entry><entry><nId>47</nId><nType>1</nType><nDemension>1</nDemension><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/hint/lvjuren_t.jpg</sImage></entry><entry><nId>48</nId><nType>1</nType><nDemension>1</nDemension><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/hint/wandousheshou_t.jpg</sImage></entry><entry><nId>49</nId><nType>1</nType><nDemension>1</nDemension><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/hint/huanlesai_t.jpg</sImage></entry><entry><nId>50</nId><nType>1</nType><nDemension>1</nDemension><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/hint/huanlesai_1_t.jpg</sImage><nScene>1</nScene></entry><entry><nId>51</nId><nType>1</nType><nDemension>1</nDemension><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/hint/huanlesai_2_t.jpg</sImage><nScene>1</nScene></entry><entry><nId>52</nId><nType>1</nType><nDemension>2</nDemension><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/hint/huanlesai_3_t.jpg</sImage><nScene>1</nScene></entry><entry><nId>53</nId><nType>1</nType><nDemension>3</nDemension><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nMapId>80</nMapId><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/hint/huanlesai_4_t.jpg</sImage><nScene>1</nScene></entry><entry><nId>54</nId><nType>1</nType><nDemension>3</nDemension><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nMapId>81</nMapId><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/hint/huanlesai_5_t.jpg</sImage><nScene>1</nScene></entry><entry><nId>55</nId><nType>1</nType><nDemension>1</nDemension><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nProbability><sImage>icon/hint/wukong_t.jpg</sImage></entry><entry><nId>56</nId><nType>1</nType><nDemension>1</nDemension><nLevelMax>30</nLevelMax><nProbability>100</nP